WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:26.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.000 --> 01:30.000
"Tamed"

3
01:32.500 --> 01:36.000
(Episode 4: Taking Care of the Master)

4
01:51.079 --> 01:52.040
Cheng.

5
01:52.040 --> 01:52.879
Cheng Yu'an.

6
01:52.879 --> 01:54.040
Wake up.

7
01:56.819 --> 01:58.040
Why did you drink so much?

8
02:54.479 --> 02:55.560
Put this on.

9
02:55.740 --> 02:56.740
It's cold outside.

10
03:02.319 --> 03:04.020
How come you're free today, Dr. Shen?

11
03:05.419 --> 03:07.080
No need to report back to my dad?

12
03:09.620 --> 03:10.800
I have Wednesdays off.

13
03:11.000 --> 03:12.639
Spying on me on your day off?

14
03:17.400 --> 03:19.439
Or is this a medical visit?

15
03:23.639 --> 03:24.639
Shen Mo.

16
03:25.500 --> 03:26.500
Look at me.

17
03:27.300 --> 03:29.159
You're my brother's therapist, right?

18
03:29.419 --> 03:31.159
Dad told you to watch him, right?

19
03:32.740 --> 03:33.919
And why are you watching me?

20
03:34.340 --> 03:35.680
Did Dad tell you to watch me,

21
03:36.319 --> 03:37.400
or...

22
03:38.680 --> 03:40.240
did you want to come yourself?

23
03:42.319 --> 03:43.080
Cheng Yuze.

24
03:43.080 --> 03:44.120
Don't use my full name.

25
03:46.800 --> 03:47.800
Shen Mo.

26
03:49.099 --> 03:50.599
Whose doctor are you, really?

27
03:50.759 --> 03:51.879
Whose spy are you?

28
03:53.199 --> 03:54.400
What are you to who?

29
03:59.719 --> 04:00.719
Shen Mo.

30
04:00.960 --> 04:02.080
You've had too much.

31
04:03.139 --> 04:04.300
You're not thinking straight.

32
04:04.680 --> 04:05.680
I am.

33
04:09.819 --> 04:11.699
Are you serious?

34
04:26.680 --> 04:27.680
Done asking?

35
04:30.560 --> 04:31.560
Not yet.

36
04:49.796 --> 04:50.488
(Day 1095, almost there. After completing the final

37
04:50.512 --> 04:51.204
verification and organization of evidence, clarifying

38
04:51.228 --> 04:51.866
the flow of funds and proof of illegality of all

39
04:51.890 --> 04:52.636
involved parties, the case has entered its final stage.)

40
05:14.323 --> 05:16.203
[Mo, when you get back, let's try the new ramen place. Brother's treat]

41
05:16.259 --> 05:17.259
Mo.

42
05:17.360 --> 05:19.220
The world owes my parents and me justice.

43
05:19.319 --> 05:20.680
Live a good life for us.

44
05:21.220 --> 05:22.220
Keep a close eye on him.

45
05:22.779 --> 05:24.059
Don't let him out of your sight.

46
05:24.759 --> 05:26.120
Especially those around him.

47
05:59.660 --> 06:00.660
Shen Mo.

48
06:01.360 --> 06:02.720
You've already made your decision.

49
06:03.360 --> 06:04.640
So keep your feelings out of it.

50
06:05.980 --> 06:07.779
You shouldn't get involved with Cheng Yuze.

51
06:08.660 --> 06:09.980
Don't forget who you are.

52
07:02.000 --> 07:03.000
Don't go.

53
07:13.199 --> 07:14.199
What?

54
07:16.319 --> 07:17.339
Don't go.

55
07:20.399 --> 07:21.560
Don't go.

56
07:31.920 --> 07:33.240
Don't go.

57
07:35.240 --> 07:36.680
I won't go.

58
08:14.860 --> 08:18.980
Are you really unbreakable?

59
08:23.939 --> 08:24.699
Cheng Yuze.

60
08:24.699 --> 08:25.980
Your brother's drunk.

61
08:26.100 --> 08:27.579
What really happened?

62
08:27.860 --> 08:29.580
Someone's been causing trouble at the firm.

63
08:29.740 --> 08:31.139
Demanding Uncle Lin's sketches.

64
08:31.519 --> 08:32.539
But don't worry.

65
08:32.799 --> 08:34.100
We'll handle it soon.

66
08:34.600 --> 08:35.500
It's past midnight.

67
08:35.500 --> 08:37.039
It's my brother's birthday today.

68
08:37.039 --> 08:38.360
I haven't got him a gift yet.

69
08:38.879 --> 08:39.879
I gotta go for now.

70
08:48.139 --> 08:49.919
Should I do something?

71
09:44.019 --> 09:45.500
What does the Pet Code say?

72
09:46.379 --> 09:48.059
Can we make an exception tonight?

73
09:49.139 --> 09:51.460
I couldn't sleep, so I was sketching.

74
09:52.019 --> 09:53.019
Sketching what?

75
09:54.299 --> 09:55.440
Nothing much.

76
09:55.440 --> 09:56.860
Just doodling.

77
09:57.759 --> 09:58.519
Give it to me.

78
09:58.740 --> 09:59.860
It's really nothing.

79
10:15.080 --> 10:17.340
You're copying your father's painting.

80
10:19.379 --> 10:20.379
Why?

81
10:27.480 --> 10:28.480
Now.

82
10:28.740 --> 10:29.980
Go back to your room and sleep.

83
10:30.120 --> 10:31.120
Right now.

84
10:31.659 --> 10:32.659
Immediately.

85
10:54.259 --> 10:55.840
Good night, then.

86
11:10.179 --> 11:11.440
Cheng Yu'an.

87
11:12.759 --> 11:14.120
What are you doing?

88
11:49.860 --> 11:51.580
Such a disobedient little puppy.

89
12:29.059 --> 12:30.059
Hello, Cheng Yuze.

90
12:30.480 --> 12:31.120
Lin Qi.

91
12:31.340 --> 12:32.340
Guess what?

92
12:32.480 --> 12:33.879
Those guys were easy to fool.

93
12:34.559 --> 12:35.559
Thanks to you.

94
12:35.600 --> 12:36.600
Otherwise,

95
12:36.659 --> 12:38.639
they'd still be pestering my brother.

96
12:39.576 --> 12:40.456
It was nothing much.

97
12:40.480 --> 12:42.220
Just a painting with a few changes.

98
12:42.460 --> 12:43.139
You're quite the artist.

99
12:43.460 --> 12:44.460
Don't be so modest.

100
12:44.620 --> 12:45.740
You've done us a huge favor.

101
12:45.860 --> 12:48.139
Think of something to ask my brother for.

102
12:49.320 --> 12:50.320
Really, there's no need.

103
12:50.759 --> 12:52.316
Your brother's let me stay all this time.

104
12:52.340 --> 12:54.419
This is the least I can do.

105
12:55.139 --> 12:56.720
Then tell me,

106
12:56.879 --> 12:58.199
what have you been wanting to do?

107
12:58.379 --> 12:59.459
You have to name something.

108
12:59.600 --> 13:00.059
Come on.

109
13:00.340 --> 13:01.379
Just between us.

110
13:01.539 --> 13:03.419
Maybe I can share in the perks.

111
13:06.159 --> 13:09.360
I'd love to see the Private Warmth VIP art exhibition.

112
13:09.740 --> 13:11.539
But you need a VIP invitation.

113
13:12.139 --> 13:13.139
Forget it.

114
13:13.480 --> 13:14.620
Just wishful thinking.

115
13:15.299 --> 13:16.980
Spare me.

116
13:17.759 --> 13:19.779
I'm really not into paintings.

117
13:20.220 --> 13:22.059
I finally escaped the Academy of Fine Arts.

118
13:22.600 --> 13:24.539
Guess I won't get any perks out of this.

119
13:24.980 --> 13:26.039
Come on!

120
13:26.039 --> 13:27.960
I can only dream about it.

121
13:28.419 --> 13:29.019
OK.

122
13:29.019 --> 13:30.419
I've got other things to do.

123
13:30.580 --> 13:31.580
Bye.

124
13:35.340 --> 13:36.340
By the way, Brother,

125
13:36.379 --> 13:37.779
Zhou Zhi restored your painting.

126
13:38.139 --> 13:39.499
I'll bring it over this afternoon.

127
13:41.700 --> 13:42.860
I'll head out now.

128
13:43.179 --> 13:44.539
Cover for me with Dad!

129
14:00.019 --> 14:01.019
Come downstairs.

130
14:02.480 --> 14:03.000
Wait,

131
14:03.000 --> 14:03.519
wait a second.

132
14:03.519 --> 14:04.139
I'm not ready.

133
14:04.139 --> 14:05.139
Now.

134
14:16.923 --> 14:18.123
[Private Warmth, VIP invitation]

135
14:18.659 --> 14:19.759
It's nothing, Cheng Yu'an.

136
14:20.340 --> 14:22.419
Just repaying him for looking after me last night.

137
14:28.759 --> 14:29.759
Get in.

138
14:30.120 --> 14:31.120
Where will we go?

139
14:31.179 --> 14:32.539
You'll find out when we get there.

140
14:46.720 --> 14:47.940
Private Warmth.

141
14:50.720 --> 14:51.720
We're here.

142
14:52.679 --> 14:53.740
Private Warmth.

143
14:53.940 --> 14:55.220
It really is Private Warmth!

144
14:55.580 --> 14:56.220
How did you know?

145
14:56.220 --> 14:56.779
Cheng Yu'an.

146
14:56.840 --> 14:57.840
Thank you.

147
15:01.299 --> 15:01.799
I'm...

148
15:01.799 --> 15:02.419
I'm sorry.

149
15:02.419 --> 15:03.500
I got too excited.

150
15:04.019 --> 15:05.019
Let's go in.

151
15:07.120 --> 15:08.279
These two sections

152
15:08.460 --> 15:09.899
feature works in different styles.

153
15:14.100 --> 15:15.100
This way, please.

154
15:15.200 --> 15:16.279
There are more over there.

155
15:22.460 --> 15:23.139
Let's look at that one.

156
15:23.480 --> 15:24.480
OK.

157
15:26.279 --> 15:27.279
Looks good to me.

158
15:33.960 --> 15:35.100
Look at this piece.

159
15:35.580 --> 15:37.539
The brushwork conveys a sense of rupture.

160
15:38.220 --> 15:39.519
As if it's saying,

161
15:40.000 --> 15:41.679
what looks calm on the surface

162
15:42.460 --> 15:44.259
is full of wounds underneath.

163
15:51.299 --> 15:53.820
I came to this gallery as a child.

164
15:54.480 --> 15:55.840
Twenty years ago,

165
15:56.639 --> 15:57.879
I took painting lessons here.

166
16:28.820 --> 16:30.340
The driver's waiting downstairs.

167
16:32.659 --> 16:33.759
I was just looking for something.

168
16:33.759 --> 16:34.759
I'll leave right now.

169
16:40.220 --> 16:41.899
How many times have I told you?

170
16:42.019 --> 16:43.779
Painting is a waste of time.

171
16:45.120 --> 16:46.120
Remember,

172
16:47.379 --> 16:49.039
the heir to Cheng Group

173
16:49.039 --> 16:51.200
doesn't need useless things like tears.

174
16:51.299 --> 16:52.039
Cheng Yu'an.

175
16:52.320 --> 16:53.320
Remember this:

176
16:53.460 --> 16:55.240
You've never liked painting.

177
16:56.460 --> 16:57.580
Come meet a friend of mine.

178
16:58.759 --> 17:00.019
His friend?

179
17:01.799 --> 17:02.639
Thank you.

180
17:02.820 --> 17:03.820
Thank you.

181
17:05.119 --> 17:06.119
This is Lin Qi.

182
17:06.180 --> 17:06.859
Lin Qi.

183
17:06.859 --> 17:07.420
Yes.

184
17:07.420 --> 17:08.119
Hello.

185
17:08.119 --> 17:08.839
Hello.

186
17:08.839 --> 17:09.539
Hello.

187
17:09.839 --> 17:10.839
Hello.

188
17:11.640 --> 17:12.960
Stay there few days?

189
17:13.220 --> 17:13.900
Oh, yeah.

190
17:14.000 --> 17:15.180
Three days.

191
17:16.099 --> 17:17.279
Three days.

192
17:17.420 --> 17:18.559
Let me think…

193
17:21.339 --> 17:22.339
This is for you.

194
17:22.579 --> 17:23.579
Thank you.

195
17:23.779 --> 17:24.899
You're really enjoying that.

196
17:25.019 --> 17:26.019
It's delicious.

197
17:34.440 --> 17:35.440
What are you doing?

198
17:35.940 --> 17:37.420
You've got something there.

199
17:38.900 --> 17:39.420
What?

200
17:39.640 --> 17:40.640
Don't do that.

201
18:22.299 --> 18:23.380
I'll take a call outside.

202
18:23.440 --> 18:24.520
It's the flower shop owner.

203
18:28.880 --> 18:29.880
He ran off.

204
18:29.940 --> 18:30.660
That's right.

205
18:30.779 --> 18:32.440
Brother, won't you go after him?

206
18:32.960 --> 18:33.960
He'll be back.

207
18:45.339 --> 18:46.700
Say no more. I get it.

208
18:47.180 --> 18:49.680
No need to explain.

209
18:51.019 --> 18:52.019
Is the cake good?

210
18:53.859 --> 18:54.859
Yeah. Thanks, Brother.

211
18:55.019 --> 18:56.019
You're welcome.

212
19:10.420 --> 19:11.339
See that?

213
19:11.400 --> 19:12.400
Yeah.

214
19:48.640 --> 19:49.160
Have some more.

215
19:49.160 --> 19:49.940
No more, thanks.

216
19:50.119 --> 19:51.119
I won't have any.

217
20:04.240 --> 20:05.519
Those two look close.

218
20:05.819 --> 20:06.819
Yeah.

219
20:07.960 --> 20:09.099
Was it something urgent?

220
20:10.619 --> 20:11.420
Nothing much.

221
20:11.420 --> 20:12.780
She'll going to fly back home.

222
20:13.220 --> 20:13.859
OK.

223
20:14.099 --> 20:15.419
Let me know if you need anything.

224
20:22.859 --> 20:23.859
Don't be like this.

225
20:32.220 --> 20:32.920
My friend.

226
20:32.920 --> 20:33.920
I gotta go for a bit.

227
20:41.480 --> 20:43.520
I'll get some dessert at the counter as well, then.

228
20:50.180 --> 20:51.180
Let's go.

229
20:56.839 --> 20:57.839
Bye-bye!

230
20:58.460 --> 20:59.140
Bye.

231
20:59.420 --> 21:00.420
Bye.

232
21:04.059 --> 21:05.099
Here's your matcha cake.

233
21:05.220 --> 21:06.220
Thank you.

234
21:57.920 --> 21:59.099
(Next Episode) You snuck out,

235
21:59.640 --> 22:00.759
and came back hurt.

236
22:01.140 --> 22:02.240
Now you're telling me,

237
22:02.960 --> 22:04.079
"That's my business"?

238
22:05.019 --> 22:06.619
You're just putting me up for now.

239
22:07.039 --> 22:08.099
Where I go,

240
22:08.099 --> 22:08.859
what I do,

241
22:08.940 --> 22:09.819
what I care about...

242
22:09.819 --> 22:10.859
None of it's your...

243
22:15.859 --> 22:16.859
Cheng Yu'an.

244
22:17.180 --> 22:18.180
So...

245
22:18.740 --> 22:20.200
Which one's the real you?

246
22:20.900 --> 22:21.900
Mom just woke up.

247
22:22.119 --> 22:23.239
She won't see outsiders yet.

248
22:25.920 --> 22:26.920
An outsider?

249
22:27.220 --> 22:28.619
I'll ask you one thing.

250
22:30.779 --> 22:31.819
Do you want me?

251
22:33.880 --> 22:35.319
We're done.
